# StyleCart - E-Commerce Website

StyleCart is a responsive e-commerce website developed using HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

## Features

* Home page
* Product listing
* Product details
* Add to cart
* Remove from cart
* Update product quantity
* Cart subtotal and total
* Coupon system
* Checkout button
* Newsletter subscription
* Blog page
* About page
* Contact page
* Responsive navigation
* LocalStorage cart management

## Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript
* Font Awesome
* Google Fonts
* LocalStorage

## Project Structure

```text
ecommerce-website/
│
├── index.html
├── shop.html
├── product.html
├── blog.html
├── about.html
├── contact.html
├── cart.html
├── style.css
├── script.js
└── README.md
```

## How to Run

1. Download or clone the project.
2. Open the project folder in VS Code.
3. Open `index.html` in a browser.
4. Start browsing the website.

## Cart System

The shopping cart uses browser LocalStorage to save products and quantities.

